# Prada L'Homme Intense — zero-origin Astra Z1 plan

Date: 2026-09-05. Request: "Why is this only one wood? ... Make it from zero."

## Current workflow amendment — computational development, one final blend

User instruction, 2026-09-05: do only computational perfumery; the complete final formula will be tested as one blend. This supersedes this task's earlier proposals for physical omission arms, A/B bottles, repeated independent bench preparations and sensory comparisons before formula selection.

The work mode is **COMPUTATIONAL_PERFUMERY_ONLY**. Compare alternatives and omissions internally in silico when useful; evaluate the complete mixture, source reliability, dose/carrier accounting, temporal behavior and uncertainty. The deliverable is **one locked final formula**, not a list of physical experiments. Preliminary physical testing is not a prerequisite for computational continuation or selection. Predicted sensory effects remain predictions, and physical/safety/release authority stays separate.

This amendment changes workflow and document status only. It does not alter Z1's ingredients, doses, stock fractions, carriers, model inputs or completed model outputs. Reuse the unchanged diagnostic evidence; verify the updated documents and unchanged quantitative payload with a focused receipt instead of rerunning the pipeline. Z1 remains a computational draft, not a newly validated or finalized formula.

## Boundary and reset

This is a new design lineage, not a revision of Astra V1 or V2. The immediate recipe parent is NONE. Both earlier designs and their receipts remain unchanged historical comparators. No inherited ingredient-count floor, dose, mandatory material, or source-preservation rule governs the new recipe. The target remains the published L'Homme Intense architecture: iris, amber, patchouli, sandalwood and airy/roasted tonka. An exact commercial clone, measured resemblance, safety, stability, physical execution and release are not claimed.

Only formula, accounting, design and diagnostic artifacts may change. No engine, backend, inventory, governance, dependency, pipeline-script or Git integration changes. Only OpenAI-native reasoning/delegation. One bounded read-only Astra wood review is independent of the parent's iris/tonka design; the parent owns selection, doses, scientific judgment and acceptance.

## Sequence and decision gates

1. Read current instructions, full live inventory and stock-authority records. Preserve all prior artifacts. DONE before this plan.
2. Establish functional architecture before stock arithmetic. Compare two genuinely different wood structures, then select distinct roles rather than a required number of woods. Challenge the closest-overlap pair first. Review iris and tonka candidates independently of the rejected recipes.
3. Check decision-relevant manufacturer/primary sources. Separate supplied-product identity, measured properties, local surrogate inputs and unknowns. Do not silently patch conflicting physics or tune against an unsupported ODT.
4. Freeze an ideal, supplied-product parts brief. Map it to actual owned stock by weighed mass, explicitly distinguishing new planned working dilutions from already prepared stock. Publish both ideal and inventory build; do not infer physical microlitres from unknown densities. Nominal 30 mL / 20% v/v is a later measured-volume bottle target, not an assertion that 6 g equals 6 mL.
5. Write a basket-first card and explicit stock/carrier/ppm accounting. Any omission/substitution questions are computational analyses only, not instructions to prepare comparison bottles. A mass-only design card must say when true raw-volume ordering and physical dosing remain unresolved.
6. Preflight all diagnostic stock labels, identities, densities used by the existing engine, exact active-product masses, carrier masses, threshold coverage and natural decomposition before a single integrated release-gate run. A nonphysical mass-faithful coordinate adapter is diagnostic only; it is never a pipetting recipe. No new pipeline scripts.
7. Run the existing formatter. Present the headspace table, five time windows and the complete formatter output verbatim in chat and append the same report to the formula. Explain model/data warnings and gate failures without changing the design merely to pass them.
8. Use focused arithmetic/parser/report/preservation checks. Run the existing deep-plane check only as a bounded diagnostic. Resolve or explicitly bound decision-relevant model uncertainty, then select and freeze one complete final candidate for the user's later whole-blend test. No full-project, empirical or release-success claim. Missing preliminary sensory evidence does not stop computational development.

## Acceptance criteria

- A genuinely new iris–sandalwood–tonka composition, with each retained wood assigned a distinct, falsifiable role.
- No ingredient retained solely because it appeared in V1/V2, no leather requirement invented from the official brief, and no numerical ingredient-count target.
- Ideal/product and raw-stock/carrier quantities reconcile; all ppm denominators are explicit. Missing stock density, basis, lot or safety facts remain missing.
- Official sources and local model contradictions are traceable. OAV is a screening quantity, not perceived percentage, similarity, liking or validated skin performance.
- V1/V2 remain byte-preserved. Z1's current stage is COMPUTATIONAL_DRAFT; a later COMPUTATIONAL_FINAL_CANDIDATE may be selected without preliminary physical tests. Neither stage implies safety, stability, observed smell, similarity, liking or release. The one final whole-blend test is downstream of computational selection.
